{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34454","headline":"和袭美寄怀南阳润卿 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美寄怀南阳润卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高抱相逢各绝尘，水经山疏不离身。\n才情未拟汤从事，玄解犹嫌竺道人。\n霞染洞泉浑变紫，雪披江树半和春。\n谁怜故国无生计，唯种南塘二亩芹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}